# Wave T43 (Coalseam kit): ironroof — the Coalseam Gym's and Museum's own roof (the two stamps the backend left sharing tr-oreburgh). RIVETED SOOT-IRON PLATE: horizontal plate bands in the town's TOWN_STYLE roof palette (light top course, mid field, shadow seam courses) with offset vertical seams, a pale rivet row along each seam course, and rust weep under two seams in the town's rust door tone. Plate-and-rivet construction — unlike Revelry's beamroof (glass bands), Copperton's coproof (copper-seamed slabs) and Cragmoor's drakeroof (shingles). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T43-COALSEAM-PLAN.md §5.)
